			"date": "2023-02-24T16:26:48.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> what’s going on over in Gatsby land. I’ve used entire operating systems with a smaller footprint.</p>",
