			"date": "2023-02-24T16:27:40.187Z",
			"content": "<p>`npm install` time (in seconds)</p><p>(forcing a clean cache, average of 5 runs)</p><p>Notably, next.js seems to bypass `npm` by vendoring its dependencies (speedier install, without those pesky npm audits)</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
