			"date": "2023-02-24T16:29:57.531Z",
			"content": "<p>Hides `npm audit` reports during installation:</p><p>Astro<br />Gatsby<br />Next (via vendoring)</p><p>Shows `npm audit` reports during installation:</p><p>Eleventy<br />Nuxt<br />Remix<br />SvelteKit</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "109920667845926390",
			"parentId": "109920662161585822",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/109920667845926390",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2023-02-24T16:31:24.273Z",
			"content": "<p>Telemetry (anonymous data collection on usage) enabled by default (requires opt-out):</p><p>Astro<br />Next.js<br />Gatsby<br />Nuxt</p><p>No known Telemetry or data collection:</p><p>Eleventy<br />Remix<br />SvelteKit</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
